  "description": "The last guy you’d expect. The one suit that changes everything. Kim Jiwon grew up in the shadows with no parents, no guidance, and no future. To him, a hoodie is more than just clothing—it is armor against a world that never once gave him a chance. But when he’s pulled into a dangerous incident, something hidden inside him awakens. Now, recruited into Baekya, a covert spy organization that works in the shadows, Jiwon faces a world of secrets, suits, and silent wars. This isn’t just survival. It’s a battle to find the life—and the look—that finally fits.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
